Module parity.types.maybeprefix.

Define Contact has email as Maybe @pii(L1, email) Text, phone as maybe Text, nick as Text?, tags as maybe list of Text.

Define Person has name as @pii(L1, name) Text?, alias as maybe Text?.

Rule describe given c as Contact and fallback as Maybe @pii(L2, name) Text, produce maybe Text:
  Return c.phone.
